  "notes": {
    "changes": {
      "fill": "teal",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "What changed\n• One header row: month · ‹ Today › · settings. Subtitle removed; Today shows only when you leave today.\n• Today = the tray icon unfolded: coral tile with a darker top band.\n• Flat weekend band instead of heavy rounded columns. Six fixed rows, so the window never jumps.\n• Agenda: all-day chips, time ranges, Now / in 3 h on today, past events dimmed, empty day links to the next event.\n• Click an event: it expands in place with time and duration, location, calendar, Copy and Open ↗.\n• Settings: Fluent selector bar (one cue), cards, 40 px rows, one-track weekday picker, keycap shortcut field, no Read-only pill, Close only.\n• New icons: coral app tile and coral live-date tile (see the Icons page).\nTry it: click days, events, arrows, Today, the settings tabs and About.",
      "w": 520,
      "x": 1340,
      "y": 552,
      "page": "windows"
    },
    "slint": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Owner decisions, 1 Nov 2026\n• Approved: darker coral band on Today and the icons (#A92A31 / #B02E35).\n• Approved: Mica backdrop on Windows 11 as optional; needs a Slint/DWM prototype.\n• Approved: expandable event details with Copy and Open in provider (Google / Outlook web; hidden for ICS).\n• Windows only: macOS dropped from the design.\n• Approved 2 Nov: a − button after Settings hides the popup to the tray, like Escape.\n• Approved 2 Nov: on the current day the month arrows sit together (‹ ›); leaving it slides them apart and fades Today in between (180 ms, ease-in-out).\nBuild notes: solid fills, rounded rects, one clip, 1–2 px borders, no blur. Window corners and shadow come from DWM.",
      "w": 520,
      "x": 1940,
      "y": 552,
      "page": "windows"
    },
